{"job_id":"F-3e16c92e02bfdc1c63fb","family_id":"F-3e16c92e02bfdc1c63fb","title":"국방부군사편찬연구소령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002856-204074-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":11,"target_id":"b2370f2227fab428d792f936c1ffdece04bcb46505435077e4ccb11d50a97087","source_hash":"a6ebc963ff48db872dbf3da865c758f41dbb00d7f97e00a74c0ce26f668bfce1","text":"国防部军事史编纂研究所少校"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002856-204074-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":80,"target_id":"bc01a844f5365eae36bcd7a5025fda28d9b085d1f4cb1414a1acedb30d820765","source_hash":"cbb4f983f73674e51a1e00c92183ee93bb76261521ddb18cdd15158910442426","text":"第一条（设立）国防部军事史研究所设立于国防部长之下，负责监督国防史、军事史和战争史的调查、收集和编纂工作。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002856-204074-ko","scope":"BODY","start":80,"end":200,"target_id":"408d16715373d82620b45799349b8c1872c73a08b2451f41653cfeaa5ad48ac8","source_hash":"3e6efbef62ed1e8a93a8338f46d7e72d1f2c73d51d223100e422c8a40cf24ef1","text":"第二条（使命）国防部军事史研究所（以下简称“研究所”）履行下列各款规定的使命。\n1. 国防史、军事史和战争史的研究与编纂\n2. 军事行动历史资料的调查与研究\n3. 各类军事相关材料的收集、保存和管理\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002856-204074-ko","scope":"BODY","start":200,"end":317,"target_id":"5401cf53f88b5ef5c14fdfd7719c2078e677ffb8427eac08bc466a3bfe6d160e","source_hash":"ed42ea3b32887d17118609e32ae5183b2ba57246719a1eea2ccb103bf2ee22bb","text":"第3条（投诉）\n①研究所设所长一名，所长应为二级或以上文职军人。<2017年9月5日修订，2018年7月17日修订>\n少将奉国防部长之命，负责监督其管辖范围内的事务，并指挥和监督下属人员。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002856-204074-ko","scope":"BODY","start":317,"end":377,"target_id":"092dd2eb629a674ee474cc80ccb63287a794a692b737cd2ae8115a13632944ee","source_hash":"568402386b4656ff88f92ebbb4c887792c09ef38069b8f5c3e1ee34f444e260f","text":"第四条（下属机构） 为研究所需要设立的部门，其组织和职责划分事宜，由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002856-204074-ko","scope":"BODY","start":377,"end":420,"target_id":"d6fabbf9a141a8353be03eca197d80a4fdd4c6835e8746a0e8ebbb776236bca6","source_hash":"f170ae25efdde07c0572d5e1a57500109eef96f42b4b84c0edb5ca0c36f7e77c","text":"第五条（人员配额）驻扎在科研机构的军事人员和文职军事雇员的人员配额由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002856-204074-ko","scope":"BODY","start":420,"end":470,"target_id":"f14f589a441b3b8c45b017fe2c032da04e305979036e978e5a9526c8b1ea00d1","source_hash":"f02e82f258c5331725616d8b667274fb8fbc2b17a571310ab9b383d0992fb640","text":"补充规定 <第16949号，2000年8月17日>\n\n本法令自2000年9月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002856-204074-ko","scope":"BODY","start":470,"end":503,"target_id":"03f30641267a45df662696bfe6d58c039352f28dfbfc2ae6da33195b865f6cc4","source_hash":"46ae83072f863724fe582dfad77d64d08ffc2625dcab5f104235e03aafc9074d","text":"补充规定（《军事人员法》实施令）<第28266号，2017年9月5日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002856-204074-ko","scope":"BODY","start":503,"end":540,"target_id":"fcca9c0c1e3dff02b93c0cfd8191c550bc7c768ae268a7b3ce6e4afcfde81843","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002856-204074-ko","scope":"BODY","start":540,"end":554,"target_id":"a94cabe3020500e3529854a863070f685a278223616aa43b9e548c1a8e07f0f8","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"条款 2 和 3 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002856-204074-ko","scope":"BODY","start":554,"end":677,"target_id":"760cfe18d1076c6795fe6a37d490f1487472155f111fae8cb16d1aa81a2b5b00","source_hash":"4ba08dc526a801f68dacc5a5c26f22b798bf4f47ffb647e150fd96f02cc68e09","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<24> 已省略\n\n  <25> 国防部军事史研究所法令部分内容修改如下。\n\n  第3条第1款中的“部级”应改为“总级”。\n\n  <26> 至 <90> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002856-204074-ko","scope":"BODY","start":677,"end":719,"target_id":"7a801ca168231c8b61cfbc505d091efdae68e88c4cd34ac7c60a4b781bcbf58d","source_hash":"b1ae93e446bb6c8f0663c649ab49ae47be99c261d4e4035b6e71cf4084afe844","text":"补充规定 <第29047号，2018年7月17日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。"}]}